Are you trying to obtain P((X+Y)<10) ?

Are X, and Y independent?

If that is the case, by simulation you can obtain the fpd of X+Y,
using the following sentences:

nsimul<-1e5
X<-rnorm(nsimul,mean=10,sd=2)
Y<-rexp(nsimul,rate=1/10)
Z<-X+Y
length(Z[Z<10])/nsimul

